{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":501831,"name":"Rafael","username":"Rafael3","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/ad7895/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T00:11:50.805Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501831-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501831-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501831-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501831-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot computer update is stuck and I cannot use Grok Bot at all.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScreen: “Updating Grok Bot’s Computer”\u003cbr\u003e\nStep: “Transferring your data” at 43%\u003cbr\u003e\nMessage: “Update still running”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI need Grok Bot restored. Please recover/reattach my existing Agent Computer on the backend.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDo NOT Reset.\u003cbr\u003e\nKeep my bots, files, logins, and chats.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlready tried:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWaiting on the update screen\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eContinue in background / Keep waiting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDid not press Reset\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is not a chat/model issue, so I have no Request ID.\u003cbr\u003e\nPrivacy Mode: [off / on / cannot disable]\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccount email: [seu email]\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot version: [versão]\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: [Mac/Windows + versão]\u003cbr\u003e\nStuck since: [hora / quanto tempo]\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501831-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501831-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on desktop.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe Agent Computer became unavailable / crashed.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe app started “Updating Grok Bot’s Computer” by itself (backup, recreate, then transfer data).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIt stays on “Transferring your data” at 43% and never finishes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe dialog does not go away after waiting, restarting the app, or using “Continue in background”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI did not press Reset.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot is unusable until this screen clears.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501831-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501831-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot computer update is stuck and I cannot use Grok Bot at all.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScreen: “Updating Grok Bot’s Computer”\u003cbr\u003e\nStep: “Transferring your data” at 43%\u003cbr\u003e\nMessage: “Update still running”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI need Grok Bot restored. Please recover/reattach my existing Agent Computer on the backend.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDo NOT Reset.\u003cbr\u003e\nKeep my bots, files, logins, and chats.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlready tried:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWaiting on the update screen\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eContinue in background / Keep waiting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDid not press Reset\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is not a chat/model issue, so I have no Request ID.\u003cbr\u003e\nPrivacy Mode: [off / on / cannot disable]\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccount email: [seu email]\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot version: [versão]\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: [Mac/Windows + versão]\u003cbr\u003e\nStuck since: [hora / quanto tempo]\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501831-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501831-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/0/30bf6c81a1281984a921580156b58d84ec6f2242.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/6Xf2CA6OLvnbMbwZ8fD3DttnGg2.png?dl=1\" title=\"Captura de Tela 2026-09-26 às 20.48.40.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/0/30bf6c81a1281984a921580156b58d84ec6f2242.png\" alt=\"Captura de Tela 2026-09-26 às 20.48.40.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"6Xf2CA6OLvnbMbwZ8fD3DttnGg2\" width=\"582\" height=\"499\" data-dominant-color=\"252525\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eCaptura de Tela 2026-09-26 às 20.48.40.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1012×868 34.7 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501831-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501831-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501831-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501831-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot Versio 4.7\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501831-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501831-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\